  {"evidence":{"distinct":483,"float":{"applicable":true,"finiteRate":1.0,"plausibleAbsMax":null,"plausibleAbsMin":null,"plausibleRate":0.0},"maxSigned":501,"maxUnsigned":501,"minSigned":1,"minUnsigned":1,"negativeCount":0,"nonZeroCount":483,"rows":483,"string":{"applicable":true,"blockCoverageRate":0.005172,"blockSize":229884,"controlCharOffsets":0,"distinctOffsets":5,"meanDecodedLength":236.8,"nonEmptyOffsets":4,"utf8DecodableOffsets":5,"validOffsetRate":0.010352},"zeroCount":0},"index":0,"inferred":"int","name":"f0","samples":["231_1","Manastorm Spells","Manastorm Spells are powerful abilities that aid you in the Manastorm, with up to four active at a time. They come in eight ranks and can be unlocked or upgraded using Bonzo Bolts at Cogsworth.","Manastorm Spells are unique, powerful abilities designed to help you navigate and survive the chaos of the Manastorm. These spells offer a wide range of effects such as bonus stats, crowd control, or utility, that can turn the tide of battle or provide crucial support in challenging scenarios.\r\n\r\nYou can equip up to four spells at a time, known as your 'Active Manastorm Spells'. These spells can be swapped out to suit your playstyle, role, or the specific challenge you're facing. You can view all of your acquired Manastorm Spells in your Spellbook, under the Ascension Manastorm Items tab.\r\n\r\nEach spell can upgrade up to eight different ranks. Higher ranks provide significantly more powerful effects, improving damage, healing, stats, or duration, based on the spell type. Upgrading your spells is essential for keeping pace with the increasing difficulty of Manastorm content.\r\n\r\nYou can use Bonzo Bolts get new spells or upgrade existing ones from Cogsworth.\r\n"],"width":4},
