  {"evidence":{"distinct":208,"float":{"applicable":true,"finiteRate":1.0,"plausibleAbsMax":null,"plausibleAbsMin":null,"plausibleRate":0.0},"maxSigned":229876,"maxUnsigned":229876,"minSigned":9,"minUnsigned":9,"negativeCount":0,"nonZeroCount":483,"rows":483,"string":{"applicable":true,"blockCoverageRate":0.196617,"blockSize":229884,"controlCharOffsets":0,"distinctOffsets":208,"meanDecodedLength":215.774,"nonEmptyOffsets":207,"utf8DecodableOffsets":208,"validOffsetRate":1.0},"zeroCount":0},"index":23,"inferred":"string","name":"f23","samples":["Manastorm Spells are powerful abilities that aid you in the Manastorm, with up to four active at a time. They come in eight ranks and can be unlocked or upgraded using Bonzo Bolts at Cogsworth.","Marks of Ascension can be earned from every type of content in the game and are stored in the Currency panel (Hotkey C -> Currency Tab). \r\n\r\nMarks can be used to buy ability purges, talent purges, gear, Heirlooms, and Mystic Enchanting items from Nozdormu.","Reforging Mystic Scrolls at an Enchanting Altar grants experience towards your realm-wide Mystic Enchanting level, rewarding a Mystic Extract each time you level up.","Marks of Ascension can be earned from many types of content and are stored in the Currency panel (Hotkey C -> Currency Tab). Marks can be spent at key vendors for progression, catch-up items, Heirlooms, gear, and Wildcard services from Silas Darkmoon.","Enchanting Altars let you obtain, collect, and apply powerful Mystic Enchants to enhance your character.\r\n\r\nYou can find permanent altars in the open world or use summonable ones, often purchased from the Auction House or Ascension Store, in major cities and quest hubs."],"width":4},
