  {"evidence":{"distinct":1,"float":{"applicable":true,"finiteRate":0.0,"plausibleAbsMax":null,"plausibleAbsMin":null,"plausibleRate":0.0},"maxSigned":0,"maxUnsigned":0,"minSigned":0,"minUnsigned":0,"negativeCount":0,"nonZeroCount":0,"rows":483,"string":{"applicable":true,"blockCoverageRate":3.9e-05,"blockSize":229884,"controlCharOffsets":0,"distinctOffsets":1,"meanDecodedLength":8.0,"nonEmptyOffsets":1,"utf8DecodableOffsets":1,"validOffsetRate":1.0},"zeroCount":483},"index":39,"inferred":"zero","name":"f39","samples":["FF00CCFF"],"width":4},
  {"evidence":{"distinct":224,"float":{"applicable":true,"finiteRate":1.0,"plausibleAbsMax":null,"plausibleAbsMin":null,"plausibleRate":0.0},"maxSigned":229876,"maxUnsigned":229876,"minSigned":9,"minUnsigned":9,"negativeCount":0,"nonZeroCount":483,"rows":483,"string":{"applicable":true,"blockCoverageRate":0.778758,"blockSize":229884,"controlCharOffsets":0,"distinctOffsets":224,"meanDecodedLength":795.821,"nonEmptyOffsets":223,"utf8DecodableOffsets":224,"validOffsetRate":1.0},"zeroCount":0},"index":40,"inferred":"string","name":"f40","samples":["Manastorm Spells are unique, powerful abilities designed to help you navigate and survive the chaos of the Manastorm. These spells offer a wide range of effects such as bonus stats, crowd control, or utility, that can turn the tide of battle or provide crucial support in challenging scenarios.\r\n\r\nYou can equip up to four spells at a time, known as your 'Active Manastorm Spells'. These spells can be swapped out to suit your playstyle, role, or the specific challenge you're facing. You can view all of your acquired Manastorm Spells in your Spellbook, under the Ascension Manastorm Items tab.\r\n\r\nEach spell can upgrade up to eight different ranks. Higher ranks provide significantly more powerful effects, improving damage, healing, stats, or duration, based on the spell type. Upgrading your spells is essential for keeping pace with the increasing difficulty of Manastorm content.\r\n\r\nYou can use Bonzo Bolts get new spells or upgrade existing ones from Cogsworth.\r\n","Marks of Ascension are a Currency earned from virtually every type of content in the game including PvP encounters, finishing a quest, or completing a dungeon or raid. These tokens are stored in your Currency panel (Hotkey C -> Currency Tab) and serve as one of the primary ways to progress and refine your character.\r\n\r\nMarks of Ascension can be spent at Nozdormu, found in your Capital City, where they can be exchanged for a wide selection of items. These include ability purges, talent purges, and Mystic Enchanting materials which can help you reset or fine-tune your build. You can also buy high-level gear, heirlooms, and other essential tools to enhance your power or level up faster.","Each time you reforge one of your Mystic Scrolls at an Enchanting Altar, you earn Mystic Enchanting Experience. Gaining enough experience will increase your Mystic Enchanting level, which rewards you with a Mystic Extract used to permanently add an enchant to your collection.\r\n\r\nYou can track your experience progress directly at any Enchanting Altar. Mystic Enchanting levels are realm-wide, meaning all your characters on the same server contribute to and share the same level progression.","Marks of Ascension are a Currency earned from many types of content including PvP encounters, finishing quests, or completing dungeons and raids. These tokens are stored in your Currency panel (Hotkey C -> Currency Tab) and serve as one of the primary ways to progress and refine your character. On Wildcard, Marks of Ascension can be used at Silas Darkmoon for Scrolls of Fortune and Skill Card Packs. Marks can also be spent at other key vendors for gear, Heirlooms, and other progression tools that help you catch up or strengthen your character.","Enchanting Altars allow you to obtain, collect, and apply thousands of potential Mystic Enchants to achieve your maximum power! \r\n\r\nYou can discover altars in the open world by finding an enchanting altar symbol on your World Map. Altars can also be summoned by your fellow players for a short duration, most often in your Capital City and other major quest hubs. \r\n\r\nSummonable enchanting altars can be obtained from the Auction House for gold or purchased from the Ascension Store for Donation Points (DP)."],"width":4},
